[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289967434","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3289967434","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3289967434,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EGOtK","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T22:17:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T22:17:07Z","body":"Lack of up/down arrows means you can no longer easily increment or decrement the value. This affects properties like `z_index`, which is now a slider.\r\n<img width=\"389\" height=\"151\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d06bc8e-61ee-48b1-adae-5cd8251aa2eb\" />\r\nCould the arrows be shown in addition to the slider?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289967434/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290926137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3290926137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3290926137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EJ4w5","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T08:00:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T08:06:56Z","body":"> Lack of up/down arrows means you can no longer easily increment or decrement the value.\r\n\r\nThe main issue was to allow sliders for exported int variables so it shouldn't affect all the editor properties alongside the fix, also it has a workaround to just change the exported variable type from int to float like this.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# Shows arrows\r\n@export_range(-60, 60, 1, \"or_greater\", \"or_less\") var my_int: int = 64\r\n\r\n# Shows Slider\r\n@export_range(-60, 60, 1, \"or_greater\", \"or_less\") var my_int: float = 64\r\n```\r\n\r\nA better fix is to add a new hint string to force sliders for integer variables, we already have \"hide_slider\" so we can add \"int_as_float\" to always treat integer properties as floats inside EditorSpinSlider.\r\n\r\n> Could the arrows be shown in addition to the slider?\r\n\r\nIt's possible but will increase the complexity of the input and draw methods.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3290926137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292552394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3292552394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3292552394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EQFzK","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T14:44:34Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T14:44:34Z","body":"@KoBeWi\r\n> Could the arrows be shown in addition to the slider?\r\n\r\nThat could work, but as Whales said, it would increase code complexity. And I would argue that it would add too much visual noise as well.\r\n\r\n@WhalesState\r\n> A better fix is to add a new hint string to force sliders for integer variables, we already have \"hide_slider\" so we can add \"int_as_float\" to always treat integer properties as floats inside EditorSpinSlider.\r\n\r\nLeaving it up to the user is indeed an option, but I would rather have something like \"force_slider\" than \"int_as_float\", since there are some changes internally when an integer is being used.\r\n\r\nI will try the extra option path, let's see how it goes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292552394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292720077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3292720077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3292720077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EQuvN","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T15:17:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T15:18:42Z","body":"> Leaving it up to the user is indeed an option, but I would rather have something like \"force_slider\" than \"int_as_float\"\r\n\r\n`use_slider` also may be a better hint, since using `force_slider` and `hide_slider` together is confusing where `force` may mean (should always be used), so we can use `force_slider` internally and `use_slider` as the hint string.\r\n\r\n> since there are some changes internally when an integer is being used.\r\n\r\nYes i just realized that we can't disable `editing_integer` so it will need another variable `force_slider` and inside the class we use `editing_integer && !force_slider` instead of `editing_integer && get_max() == get_min()`, and inside `EditorPropertyInteger::setup` we add an extra argument for `use_slider` which sets `EditorSpinSlider::force_slider` to true.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3292720077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293355127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3293355127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3293355127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ETJx3","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T18:07:40Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T18:07:40Z","body":"Reworked, see the OP.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293355127/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293502825","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3293502825","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3293502825,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ETt1p","user":{"login":"WhalesState","id":53877170,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODc3MTcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53877170?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState","html_url":"https://github.com/WhalesState","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WhalesState/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T18:54:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T18:54:49Z","body":"> Reworked, see the OP.\r\n\r\nWe could have introduced a new variable like `EditorSpinSlider::force_slider` and avoided breaking compatibility by renaming the hint from `hide_slider` to `hide_control`.\r\n\r\nBy only adding one more string hint `use_slider` or `force_slider`, we keep the fix minimal while preserving compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293502825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293529414","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3293529414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3293529414,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ET0VG","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T19:03:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T19:04:42Z","body":"> By only adding one more string hint use_slider or force_slider, we keep the fix minimal while preserving compatibility.\r\n\r\nThe \"hide_slider\" hint is still present, no compatibility was broken. The one replaced was the property, which still exists, but deprecated.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293529414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293568088","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3293568088","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3293568088,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ET9xY","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T19:15:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T19:15:44Z","body":"I remember @Calinou wanted to do this but he wasn't quite sure, because availability of a slider was a giveaway that the property is a `float`. Without one it's not as clear. But, eh.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293568088/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298638042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3298638042","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3298638042,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EnTja","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T12:54:34Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T12:54:34Z","body":"> availability of a slider was a giveaway that the property is a float. Without one it's not as clear\r\n\r\n`.0` suffix clarifies that.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"79\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77af0917-d7cc-46bb-acc5-3f5492e43c1f\" />\r\n\r\nAlthough it seems to depend on step value, not the type 🙃","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3298638042/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299201294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3299201294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3299201294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EpdEO","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T15:06:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T15:06:12Z","body":"> Although it seems to depend on step value, not the type 🙃\r\n\r\nChanged to do so. Makes more sense.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299201294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3320759502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110459#issuecomment-3320759502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110459","id":3320759502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7F7sTO","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-22T18:39:03Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T18:39:03Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3320759502/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]